cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use modMARL in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "modMARL: modular multi-agent reinforcement learning with communication"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Montana
    given-names: Giovanni
    email: giovanni.montana@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/gmontana/modMARL"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-01"
abstract: >-
  A curated library of cooperative multi-agent reinforcement learning algorithms
  focused on agent-to-agent communication, together with centralized-critic and
  independent baselines. Includes behavioral tests, recorded multi-seed learning
  evidence, and explicit per-method validation limits and implementation choices.
